{
	"schema_version": 1,
	"comment": "Feature flags for Steamworks readiness. Offline/stub is the default so CI, itch, and editor runs never require Steam. Store URLs stay empty until Partner assigns a real AppID — wishlist CTAs hide on itch/DRM-free and when URLs still contain YOUR_APP_ID.",
